@startuml CameraProxy-Architecture
' ==========================================================================
'  CameraProxy 整体架构图
' --------------------------------------------------------------------------
'  展示三大模块、两大进程、核心组件及其依赖关系
' ==========================================================================

title CameraProxy — 跨进程相机共享框架 · 整体架构

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam backgroundColor #FDFDFD

skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #E8F4FD
  BorderColor     #3B82F6
  FontColor       #111827
}
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
  BorderColor     #9CA3AF
  FontColor       #111827
}
skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor #FEF3C7
  BorderColor     #D97706
}

' ---------- AIDL 共享契约 ----------
package "aidl (共享库)" as AIDL #FFF7ED {
  interface ICameraProxyService <<AIDL>>
  interface ICameraCallback     <<AIDL>>
  component CameraCapabilities  <<Parcelable>>
}

' ---------- Client 进程 ----------
package "Client 进程\ncom.example.cameraproxy.client" as CLIENT_PROC #ECFDF5 {
  component "MainActivity\n(SurfaceView 容器)" as ClientActivity
  component "ICameraCallback.Stub\n(回调实现)"    as ClientCallback
  component "SurfaceView\n.holder.surface"       as ClientSurface
}

' ---------- Server 进程 :camera ----------
package "Server 进程 :camera\ncom.example.cameraproxy.server" as SERVER_PROC #EFF6FF {

  component "MainActivity\n(启动面板 + 权限申请)" as ServerActivity

  package "CameraHolderService\n(前台服务, foregroundServiceType=camera)" as SERVICE #DBEAFE {
    component "ICameraProxyService.Stub\n(Binder 入口)"          as BinderStub
    component "SubscriberRecord Map\n(id → callback + deathRecipient)" as Records
    component "controlOwner\n(AtomicReference<Int?>)"            as CtrlOwner
  }

  package "CameraEngine\n(相机 + GL 核心)" as ENGINE #DBEAFE {
    component "Camera Thread\n(HandlerThread)"     as CamThread
    component "CameraDevice"                       as CamDevice
    component "CameraCaptureSession"               as CapSession
    component "GL Thread\n(HandlerThread)"          as GlThread
    component "SurfaceTexture\n(OES 消费端)"        as STex
    component "OES Texture ID"                      as OesTex
  }

  package "gl/ (OpenGL ES 2.0 封装)" as GL #DBEAFE {
    component "EglCore\n(EGLDisplay / Context / Surface)" as EglCore
    component "OesTextureProgram\n(Shader + 全屏四边形)"   as Program
  }
}

' ---------- 关系 ----------

' Client 侧组合
ClientActivity --> ClientCallback : 创建并传给 Server
ClientActivity --> ClientSurface  : 提供显示容器
ClientActivity --> ServerActivity : (同设备不同 App, 无直接调用)

' Client → Server 跨进程 AIDL 调用
ClientActivity ..> ICameraProxyService : bindService\nsubscribe / openCamera
ICameraProxyService .right.> BinderStub
BinderStub ..> ICameraCallback : 反向 Binder\nonFrameStart / onError
ICameraCallback ..> ClientCallback

' Server 内部编排
ServerActivity --> SERVICE : startForegroundService
BinderStub --> Records : 增删订阅档案
BinderStub --> CtrlOwner : CAS 互斥控制权
BinderStub --> ENGINE  : addSubscriber / removeSubscriber

' 相机 + GL 数据流
CamDevice --> CapSession
CapSession --> STex : 每帧写入\n(GraphicBuffer)
STex --> OesTex : updateTexImage()\n绑定 OES 纹理
OesTex --> Program : 采样\n(samplerExternalOES)
Program --> EglCore : glDraw + swapBuffers

' GL 输出 → 回到 Client
EglCore ..> ClientSurface : eglSwapBuffers\n(跨进程, 零拷贝)

' 线程归属
CamThread -[hidden]-> CamDevice
GlThread  -[hidden]-> STex
GlThread  -[hidden]-> Program

' 说明
note right of ENGINE
  **Fan-out 核心**:
  一个 OES 纹理 →
  for each subscriber:
    makeCurrent(EGLSurface_i)
    draw(oesTex, stMatrix)
    swapBuffers(EGLSurface_i)
end note

note bottom of SERVICE
  **订阅管理**:
  • subscribe → 生成 ID + linkToDeath
  • Client 崩溃 → 自动 unsubscribe
  • 最后一个订阅者退出 → closeCamera
end note

@enduml


@startuml CameraProxy-Subscribe-Sequence
' ==========================================================================
'  订阅流程时序图 —— Client bindService 到首帧上屏
' ==========================================================================

title 订阅流程时序图 · bindService → subscribe → 首帧

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam backgroundColor #FDFDFD
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "用户" as User
participant "Client\nMainActivity" as Client
participant "Server\nCameraHolder\nService (Binder)" as Service
participant "Camera\nEngine" as Engine
participant "GL Thread\n(glHandler)" as Gl
participant "Camera2\nCameraDevice" as Cam2

== 1. 启动 & 绑定 ==
User -> Client : 打开 App
activate Client
Client -> Service : bindService(ACTION_BIND)
activate Service
Service --> Client : onServiceConnected(IBinder)
Client -> Client : proxy = Stub.asInterface()

== 2. Surface 就绪 ==
Client -> Client : surfaceCreated(holder)
note right: SurfaceView 创建完成

== 3. 打开相机（幂等） ==
Client -> Service : openCamera("0", 1280, 720, PRIVATE)
Service -> Engine : openCamera(..)
activate Engine
Engine -> Gl : runOnGlThreadBlocking {\n  EglCore + OES Tex\n  + SurfaceTexture\n}
activate Gl
Gl --> Engine : GL 就绪
deactivate Gl
Engine -> Cam2 : manager.openCamera(..)
activate Cam2
Cam2 --> Engine : onOpened(device)
Engine -> Cam2 : createCaptureSession([cameraInputSurface])
Cam2 --> Engine : onConfigured(session)
Engine -> Cam2 : setRepeatingRequest(TEMPLATE_PREVIEW)
deactivate Cam2
Engine --> Service : true
deactivate Engine
Service --> Client : true

== 4. 订阅 ==
Client -> Service : subscribe(surface, callback)
activate Service
Service -> Engine : addSubscriber(surface)
activate Engine
Engine -> Gl : createWindowSurface(surface)
activate Gl
Gl --> Engine : EGLSurface
deactivate Gl
Engine --> Service : engineId=1
deactivate Engine
Service -> Service : callback.asBinder()\n  .linkToDeath(..)
Service -> Service : records[1] = SubscriberRecord
Service --> Client : subscriberId=1
deactivate Service

== 5. 首帧渲染（异步循环） ==
Cam2 -> Gl : onFrameAvailable\n(SurfaceTexture)
activate Gl
Gl -> Gl : makeCurrent(dummy)\nupdateTexImage\ngetTransformMatrix
loop 对每个订阅者
  Gl -> Gl : makeCurrent(eglSurface_i)
  Gl -> Gl : glViewport + glClear
  Gl -> Gl : program.draw(oesTex, stMatrix)
  Gl -> Client : eglSwapBuffers\n(跨进程 Surface)
end
Gl -> Service : listener.onFirstFrame()
Service -> Client : callback.onFrameStart()
deactivate Gl
Client -> User : 预览显示首帧
deactivate Client

@enduml


@startuml CameraProxy-Unsubscribe-Sequence
' ==========================================================================
'  反注册时序图 —— 两条路径：主动 unsubscribe vs. 进程死亡
' ==========================================================================

title 反注册时序图 · 主动退订 vs. 客户端崩溃

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam backgroundColor #FDFDFD

participant "Client" as Client
participant "Service\n(Binder)" as Service
participant "Engine" as Engine
participant "GL Thread" as Gl

== 路径 A：Client 主动退订（onStop） ==
Client -> Service : unsubscribe(id=1)
Service -> Service : records.remove(1)
Service -> Service : unlinkToDeath
Service -> Engine : removeSubscriber(1)
activate Engine
Engine -> Engine : binding.valid = false
Engine -> Gl : releaseSurface(eglSurface)
deactivate Engine
Service -> Service : controlOwner.CAS(1, null)
alt 无订阅者
  Service -> Engine : closeCamera()
  Engine -> Gl : 释放 GL / 停线程
end

== 路径 B：Client 进程崩溃 ==
note over Client : Client 进程被杀 / 崩溃
Service -> Service : deathRecipient.binderDied()\n(Binder 线程触发)
Service -> Service : internalUnsubscribe(1)\n(走上面同一套清理)
note right of Service
  linkToDeath 是保障：
  即使 Client 没机会调
  unsubscribe 也不会泄漏
end note

@enduml


@startuml CameraProxy-Frame-Fanout
' ==========================================================================
'  帧分发数据流 —— 一路采集如何变成多路输出
' ==========================================================================

title 帧分发数据流 · GL Fan-out (零拷贝)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam backgroundColor #FDFDFD
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #E8F4FD
  BorderColor     #3B82F6
}
skinparam queue {
  BackgroundColor #FEF3C7
  BorderColor     #D97706
}

component "Camera HAL\n(硬件传感器)" as HAL

queue "GraphicBuffer\n(BufferQueue)" as GB

component "SurfaceTexture\n(OES 消费端)" as ST
component "OES Texture ID\n(GL_TEXTURE_EXTERNAL_OES)" as OES

component "OesTextureProgram\n(Shader 程序)" as PROG

component "EGLSurface #1\n(订阅者 A)" as S1
component "EGLSurface #2\n(订阅者 B)" as S2
component "EGLSurface #3\n(订阅者 C)" as S3

component "Client A\nSurfaceView" as CA
component "Client B\nSurfaceView" as CB
component "Client C\nSurfaceView" as CC

HAL --> GB : 写入 YUV/PRIVATE\n(硬件 DMA)
GB --> ST : 出队一帧
ST --> OES : updateTexImage()\n绑定到当前纹理
OES --> PROG : samplerExternalOES 采样

PROG --> S1 : makeCurrent\ndraw + swap
PROG --> S2 : makeCurrent\ndraw + swap
PROG --> S3 : makeCurrent\ndraw + swap

S1 ..> CA : 跨进程 Surface
S2 ..> CB : 跨进程 Surface
S3 ..> CC : 跨进程 Surface

note bottom of OES
  **同一个 OES 纹理被 N 次采样**
  GraphicBuffer 内存只驻留一份
  GL 驱动内部直接把 YUV
  硬件转换为 RGBA 送显
end note

note right of PROG
  单线程顺序执行:
  for each subscriber:
    1. makeCurrent(EGLSurface_i)
    2. glViewport
    3. drawQuad(oesTex)
    4. eglSwapBuffers
  不重建 CaptureSession
  不重建 GL Context
  不经过 CPU 内存拷贝
end note

@enduml


@startuml CameraProxy-Thread-Model
' ==========================================================================
'  线程模型 —— 谁在哪条线程上做什么
' ==========================================================================

title 线程模型 · 各组件归属线程

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam backgroundColor #FDFDFD

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor<<main>>    #FEE2E2
  BorderColor<<main>>        #DC2626
  BackgroundColor<<binder>>  #FEF3C7
  BorderColor<<binder>>      #D97706
  BackgroundColor<<camera>>  #DBEAFE
  BorderColor<<camera>>      #3B82F6
  BackgroundColor<<gl>>      #DCFCE7
  BorderColor<<gl>>          #16A34A
}

rectangle "主线程 (Main)" <<main>> {
  usecase "Activity 生命周期\nonStart / onStop" as L1
  usecase "UI 更新\nTextView.setText" as L2
  usecase "bindService / SurfaceView 回调" as L3
}

rectangle "Binder 线程池" <<binder>> {
  usecase "AIDL 方法实现\nsubscribe / unsubscribe\nopenCamera" as L4
  usecase "ICameraCallback 反向调用\nonFrameStart" as L5
  usecase "DeathRecipient 触发\nbinderDied" as L6
}

rectangle "camera-proxy-cam 线程" <<camera>> {
  usecase "CameraDevice.StateCallback\nonOpened / onError" as L7
  usecase "CaptureSession.StateCallback\nonConfigured" as L8
  usecase "setRepeatingRequest 回调" as L9
}

rectangle "camera-proxy-gl 线程" <<gl>> {
  usecase "EglCore 初始化\nmakeCurrent / swapBuffers" as L10
  usecase "SurfaceTexture.updateTexImage\ndrawFrame fan-out" as L11
  usecase "EGLSurface 创建 / 释放" as L12
}

L3 -down-> L4 : bindService\n后续 AIDL 调用
L4 -down-> L7 : Camera2 API 异步回调
L4 -right-> L10 : runOnGlThreadBlocking
L9 -down-> L11 : onFrameAvailable\n(SurfaceTexture 安排到 GL)
L11 -up-> L5 : listener.onFirstFrame\n(经 Service 转发)
L5 -up-> L2 : Handler.post 切回主线程

note bottom
  **关键纪律**:
  • GL 调用只在 GL 线程（context 绑定线程）
  • Camera2 回调只在 camera 线程
  • AIDL Binder 方法切 GL 线程前必须用 Handler.post 同步（runOnGlThreadBlocking）
  • Client 回调必须 Handler.post 回主线程才能动 UI
end note

@enduml
